  "notes": "GPIO numbers are printed bare (25, 13...), so label = CircuitPython name with the GPIO number first in functions, then outward. Board silkscreen spellings that differ (Rst, 3V, VHi, BAT, G, USB) placed first. Underscores invisible on dark tags; written SENSE_CAP-, SENSE_CAP+, SENSE_V+, 32K_XN, 32K_XP. NeoPixel, NeoPixel power and BUTTON (35) are not header pins and were skipped."
